      "id": "TgAtUsZO1OU",
      "title": "FATAL FURY: CotW ｜ Duck King",
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-27T07:00:07Z",
      "durationSec": 100,
      "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TgAtUsZO1OU/mqdefault.jpg",
      "description": "Duck King joins City of the Wolves today as part of Season 3! \n\n■ Duck King  (Voice Actors: Cedric Williams)\nGet down on it with South Town’s resident dancing king! Duck is South Town to the core; after all, he not only has a friendly rivalry with its hero Terry Bogard (after losing to him in his youth), but also a deep love for iconic hangout Pao Pao Café. Indeed, Pao Pao is where you’ll mostly find this old-school breaker, living it up like only he knows how: with fights, festivities, and tons of dance floor fever. When rhythmic royalty hits the stage, nothing can stay away or stop him—not even time itself! \n\n💻Official Site \nhttps://www.snk-corp.co.jp/us/games/fatalfury-cotw/\n📶X\nhttps://x.com/FATALFURY_PR\n📶Instagram\nhttps://www.instagram.com/fatalfury_pr/\n📶TikTok\nhttps://www.tiktok.com/@fatalfury_cotw\n\n©SNK CORPORATION ALL RIGHTS RESERVED. \n#FatalFury #餓狼伝説 #CotW #SNK",
